start: mr
R1: 2ch=dc ch [dc@ring ch]x11 join
R2: 2ch=dc ch [2dc@sp ch]x11 dc@start join # page doesn't say where R2/R3 start: written as a group split over the join
R3: 2ch=dc dc@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x11 dc@start join
R4: [3dc@sp ch 3dc@sp {3tr 2ch 3tr}@sp ch]x4 join fo # page says "11 x"; 12 ch-1 sps / 3 per repeat = 4
